+# Transport Compression Codec
+
+No transport compression codec is currently recorded as a project decision. The only recorded finding on this topic is that the gin codebase does not implement any compression mechanism in production code (no gzip, lz4, or similar, and no `Content-Encoding` handling), so there is no incumbent codec and no codec has been chosen to replace or extend that baseline.
